{
  "text": "紫微斗數全書",
  "juan": "卷一",
  "section": "定貴局",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L000",
      "original_quote": "定貴局",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L001",
      "original_quote": "定貴局⽇⽉夾命不坐空亡遇逢本宮有吉星是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L002",
      "original_quote": "⽇出扶桑⽇在卯守命是也,守官祿宮亦然｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L003",
      "original_quote": "⽉落亥宫⽉在亥守命是也,⼜名⽉朗天⾨｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L004",
      "original_quote": "⽉⽣滄海⽉在⼦宮守⽥宅是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L005",
      "original_quote": "輔弼拱主紫微守命⼆星來拱是也,夾之亦然｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L006",
      "original_quote": "君⾂慶會紫微左右同守命是也,更會相武陰妙上｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L007",
      "original_quote": "財印夾祿祿守命梁相來夾是也,入財亦然｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L008",
      "original_quote": "祿⾺佩印⾺前有祿印星同宮是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L009",
      "original_quote": "坐貴向貴謂魁鉞在命迭相坐拱是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L010",
      "original_quote": "⾺頭帶劍謂⾺有刃是也不是居午格｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L011",
      "original_quote": "七殺朝⽃⾒前註解⽇⽉並明⾒前註解明珠出海⾒前註解⽇⽉同臨⾒前註解刑囚夾印天刑廉貞同臨⾝命主武勇之⼈｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L012",
      "original_quote": "科權祿拱⾒前註解貪火相逢謂⼆星守命同居廟旺是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L013",
      "original_quote": "武曲守垣武守命卯宮是也,餘不是｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L014",
      "original_quote": "府相朝垣⾒前註解紫府朝垣⾒前註解⽂星暗拱⾒前註解權祿⽣逢⼆星守命廟旺是也,陷不是｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L015",
      "original_quote": "⽺刃入廟辰戌丑未守命遇吉是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_DingGuiJu_L016",
      "original_quote": "巨機居卯⾒前註解明祿暗祿⾒前註解科明暗祿⾒前註解⾦輿扶駕紫微守命前後有⽇⽉來夾是也｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    }
  ],
  "_source": {
